        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{3}{10}$",
          "worked": "The green marbles are numbered $4,5,6,7,8$. The favourable numbers are $4,6,8$: three of the ten equally likely outcomes.\n\n$$P(\\text{green and even})=\\frac{3}{10}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
